        },
        {
          "text": "Sa nsikonzyi kumucitila anywebo mbubonya mbuli oyu mubumbi mbwacita, O luzubo lwa-Israyeli? mbwaamba Jehova. Amubone! Mbubonya mbuli bulongo mbubuli mumaanza aamubumbi, anywebo muli mumaanza aangu, O luzubo lwa-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
