                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ambila bantu ba-Juda abaabo bakede mu-Jerusalemu kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Ncobeni ndili mukukanza kumubisizya, ndili mukuyeeya miyeeyo yakumupenzya. Amupiluke, muleke umwi aumwi bubi bwanzila yakwe. Amubotye inzila zyanu amilimo yanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
