        {
          "text": "Pele balaamba kuti, Nee! Tunoocitobela miyeeyo yesu, tunoocicita umwi aumwi makanze aazinguni zyamoyo wakwe mubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
