        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakaamba kuti, Amuboole, tukavwiye Jeremiya. Bapaizi tababuli lulayo, basongo taba buli maanu, abasinsimi tababuli majwi, Amuboole, tumukantamike. Tutayoowi majwi aakwe abuniini.",
          "type": "text",
